  "translation": "Bathi kuye: “Umnye umntu wenyuka wasibamba nendlela, wathi kuthi: ‘Hambani, buyelani kwi⟨the⟩nkosi owanithumela yona ⟨את⟩, nithethe kuye ukuba: Kutsho uYahwe: Ngaba kungenxa yokuba akukho uElohim kwaIsrayeli, wena uthuma ukuba kubuzwe kwiBaal-Zevuvh, uthixo waseEkron? Ngoko ibhedi owenyukela kuyo, awunakwehla kuwo, kuba uya kufa ngokwenene.’”",
